    "Reviewed retained core identity contract, not a minimum count and not a list derived from the current registry during a test.",
    "The historical snapshot is the literal CORE_TOOLS declarations at the exact source below. Tool packs are outside this required core set.",
    "The named retirements remove the retired engine-hosted service, not arbitrary missing capabilities. Additions are the reviewed resource, agent-lifecycle, build-queue and generic app/accessibility and Seedance video tools, bounded sandbox artifact reads, and durable ledger reads. This reconciliation also retains the two Page 2 screen-access tools.",
