    "t_ledger.progress (a7ee8f37, 2026-09-10) joins its three t_ledger siblings here: a bounded non-terminal progress or external-blocker checkpoint on an unfinished one-shot task, local-write and idempotent, terminal tasks stay terminal. It shipped in the registry without this reconciliation, which is what tests/tool-effect-classification.test.js reported. Nothing is removed.",
    "Explicitly reconcile capability.find (session-filtered metadata read) and five opt-in agent.set_* slot controls. This adds public identities only; permission, role and tree-ownership gates remain independent.",
    "T1138 adds t_ledger.review for explicit idempotent task reviews. Transport-bound actor, local-write permission and authoritative store review policy remain required; this addition retires no identity."
